                              "content": "The ledger is filtered by role, not just the sections above it. Three money entries an Owner sees are absent here, because ADR-0008 gives an employed Doula no read on Contract money or Invoice history — and an audit trail that leaked them would be a way round the gate. That filtering is why this has to be one queryable log with a subject and an actor, not six tables merged in the browser.",
