                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "What you owe sits second, above the documents. Nadia's journey names it the question she is most likely to have and least likely to ask out loud, and no Client can answer it on any screen today (#297). No care phase anywhere, on any width.",
